
### 🧠 AI Resume Analyzer (Employee)
Project Summary

The AI Resume Analyzer & ATS System is a web-based application that automates resume evaluation and recruitment screening using Machine Learning and NLP. It helps job seekers understand ATS performance and assists recruiters in shortlisting candidates efficiently.

Steps Involved in the Project

Resume Upload

User uploads resume in PDF or DOCX format

Text Extraction

Resume text is extracted using document parsing libraries

Text Preprocessing

Cleaning, lower-casing, and removing unwanted symbols

Feature Extraction

Convert text into numerical form using TF-IDF

Role Prediction

Resume content matched with predefined job roles

ATS Score Calculation

Score computed based on skill match and structure

Skill Analysis

Identify matched and missing skills

Selection Probability

Confidence percentage calculated

Recruiter Screening

Job description matched with multiple resumes

Final Recommendation

Resume improvement suggestions or shortlist decision

